        "pb_svc_1_title": "Service 1",
        "pb_svc_1_good_just": "[Scope] Standard leak detection for up to 1 location (under 2,000 sq ft). Includes basic acoustic scanning and visible plumbing inspection. Excludes slab penetrations.",
