        "ai_title": "The Future of Plumbing: Introduction Guide to the AI Era",
        "ai_intro_1": "Welcome to the Morales Academy. I am your Senior Instructor and today I am not just handing you a wrench, but the keys to the most advanced technological ecosystem in the history of water services.",
        "ai_intro_2": "At Morales Plumbing, we have left behind the era of manual guesswork to enter the era of 'surgical precision'. You are not simply apprentices; you are the new technical elite of Silicon Valley, an operative force that combines the sweat of the trade with the brains of Military-Grade artificial intelligence.",
        "ai_intro_3": "Look at our shield: that translucent water drop guíarding a microchip inside is not just design. It symbolizes our 'Tech-Service' philosophy: the absolute control of flow through digital innovation.",
        "ai_quote": "\"Our mission is to provide solutions of the highest quality, fusing artisanal technical experience with advanced AI technologies to protect public health and the integrity of homes quickly and definitively.\"  Morales Plumbing Philosophy",
        "ai_intro_4": "This cutting-edge mentality is what separates a conventional plumber from a Morales Academy technological consultant. To master this environment, your first tool will not be a blowtorch, but your digital copilot.",
        "ai_s1_title": "1. Your Digital Copilot: Who is Karla AI?",
        "ai_s1_p1": "On the battlefield of water infrastructure, knowledge is power. Karla AI is our muúltimodal virtual assistant, a Large Language Model (LLM) that has been fine-tuned specifically with the California Plumbing Code (CPC) and the technical schematics of leading manufacturers. Karla does not 'guess'; Karla processes vector data in real time.",
        "ai_s1_p2": "Through Oóptical Character Recognition (OCR), you can scan the data plate of any equipment and Karla AI will deliver, in less than 3 seconds, the exact manual and the step-by-step diagnostic tree. This tool is the reason why we reduce diagnostic time by 40%.",
        "ai_t_h1": "Feature",
        "ai_t_h2": "Traditional Method (Guesswork)",
        "ai_t_h3": "Morales Method (Karla AI)",
        "ai_t_r1_1": "Diagnosis",
        "ai_t_r1_2": "Based on 'trial and error'.",
        "ai_t_r1_3": "Based on vector data and exact manuals.",
        "ai_t_r2_1": "Knowledge Retrieval",
        "ai_t_r2_2": "Minutes or hours searching through PDFs.",
        "ai_t_r2_3": "< 3 seconds via natural language.",
        "ai_t_r3_1": "Information",
        "ai_t_r3_2": "Manual search in books or internet.",
        "ai_t_r3_3": "Instant access via data plate OCR.",
        "ai_t_r4_1": "Speed",
        "ai_t_r4_2": "Slow, prone to second visits.",
        "ai_t_r4_3": "40% faster; resolution on the first appointment.",
        "ai_s1_p3": "This efficiency allows us to be infallible not only in technique, but also in the regulatory shielding of each intervention.",
        "ai_s2_title": "2. PlumbAssist AI: Your Techúnical Compliance Guíarantee",
        "ai_s2_p1": "As California's elite, we operate under a legal microscope. PlumbAssist AI is your compliance guíardian. As you work, this system cross-references every decision with the California Plumbing Code (CPC) in real time. But its function goes beyond technical regulations; it is integrated with the Morales Legal Generator. This system automates the creation of critical documents that protect our liability and the client's rights, ensuring every contract is impregnable.",
        "ai_s2_li1": "<strong>Regulatory Security:</strong> Instant CPC lookup, eliminating errors due to poor memorization.",
        "ai_s2_li2": "<strong>Automatic Document Management:</strong> Immediate generation of 'Right to Cancel' notices and the 'Notice to Owner' (NTO) document to protect our mechanics' lien rights.",
        "ai_s2_li3": "<strong>Liability Shielding:</strong> Creates customized waivers before initiating any destructive work.",
        "ai_s2_p2": "Data and laws protect our liability, but our sensors allow us to see through solid concrete.",
        "ai_s3_title": "3. Seeing the Invisible: FLIR Thermography with Artificial Intelligence",
        "ai_s3_p1": "To achieve true Military-Grade precision, we use high-resolution thermal imaging cameras (FLIR E8-XT or C5 models). By integrating these cameras with AI algorithms, we perform 'Thermal Mapping' that identifies temperature gradients invisible to the human eye.",
        "ai_s3_p2": "This allows us to detect 'floral anomalies' the thermal plume or 'feathering' effect generated by hot water escaping under a slab locating slab leaks without unnecessary demolition. The high-end MSX (Multi-Spectral Dynamic Imaging) Technology extracts structural details from the visual camera and embosses them onto the thermal image.",
        "ai_s3_p3": "Thanks to MSX and AI processing, the margin of error for locating a rupture under concrete is reduced to less than 3 square inches. Once we have 'seen' the invisible, the next step is to present the solution with the same level of technological sophistication.",
        "ai_s4_title": "4. The Tablet as a Closing Tool: Orion Price Book",
        "ai_s4_p1": "Extreme professionalism is consolidated at the moment of quoting. The Orion Price Book POS system uses sales psychology to eliminate price friction. We always present three options: 'Good, Better, Best'.",
        "ai_s4_p2": "As instructors, we teach you the secret: the 'Best' (Premium) option works as a price anchor, making the 'Better' (Recommended) option perceived as the highest logical value. This is where we transform a repair into an asset upgrade. For a successful close, follow this protocol on your tablet:",
        "ai_s4_li1": "<strong>Visual Evidence:</strong> Show the client the images from the FLIR camera and the Karla AI report.",
        "ai_s4_li2": "<strong>Presentation of Options:</strong> Offer real solutions, like a Navien NPE-240A for endless hot water or a comprehensive repiping system with Uponor PEX-A.",
        "ai_s4_li3": "<strong>Flat Rate Transparency:</strong> Use upfront pricing. The client pays for the solution, not for the hours you spend on site.",
        "ai_s4_li4": "<strong>Closing and Legal Signature:</strong> The client signs the contract generated by the Morales Legal Generator, receiving their digital copy instantly.",
        "ai_s4_p3": "This process generates a 'hyper-professionalism' that justifies our premium rates and consolidates your authority with the client.",
        "ai_s5_title": "5. Conclusion: The Technician of Tomorrow",
        "ai_s5_p1": "At Morales Academy, we are not training you to be plumbers; we are training you to manage a high-tech ecosystem. By mastering Karla AI, military-grade thermography, and the Orion system, we guíarantee a first-visit resolution rate of over 95%.",
        "ai_s5_p2": "You are the future of a trade dignified by science. You do not just repair pipes; you protect Silicon Valley's infrastructure with the precision of a surgeon and the intelligence of a data engineer. Remember: innovation and technical dignity are our banner. Welcome to the elite.",
        "ai_s5_p3": "Welcome to Morales Plumbing.",
