        "pb_svc_5_better_tools": "Ridgid SeeSnake standard camera, NaviTrack Scout Locator (512 Hz Sonde receiver).",
        "pb_svc_5_better_time": "2-3 hrs",
        "pb_svc_5_best_just": "[Scope] Ultra-Premium HD Inspection + Full Diagnostics. Includes digital incline reporting, lateral branching survey, and a fully typed PACP-certified condition report for real estate or insurance.",
        "pb_svc_5_best_mat": "Digital PACP report software license, high-capacity SD cards, dedicated server hosting for report.",
        "pb_svc_5_best_tools": "Ridgid SeeSnake CSx TruSense con HD, sensores de inclinacin, localizador digital.",
        "pb_svc_5_best_time": "3-5 hrs",
        "pb_svc_6_title": "Service 6",
        "pb_svc_6_good_just": "[Scope] Trenchless Epoxy Pipe Lining (CIPP) for up to 20 feet of 4\" sewer line. Fixes root penetrations and minor cracks without excavation. Includes pre-jetting.",
        "pb_svc_6_good_mat": "Cured-in-place pipe (CIPP) felt liner, 2-part epoxy structural resin, calibration tube, high-temp curing tape.",
        "pb_svc_6_good_tools": "Air inversion drum, 100 CFM air compressor, steam/hot water boiler unit for curing, hydro-jetter.",
        "pb_svc_6_good_time": "1 Day",
        "pb_svc_6_better_just": "[Scope] Pipe Bursting Replacement for up to 50 feet of 4\" sewer line. Seamless HDPE pipe installation. Requires two small excavation pits (insertion and reception). Includes basic soil backfill.",
        "pb_svc_6_better_mat": "50ft of SDR-17 Seamless High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE) pipe, bursting head, fusion welding rods.",
        "pb_svc_6_better_tools": "Tric Tools hydraulic pipe bursting puller, butt-fusion welding machine, mini-excavator.",
        "pb_svc_6_better_time": "2 Days",
        "pb_svc_6_best_just": "[Scope] Ultra-Premium Trenchless Full System (up to 100 ft). Includes dual bidirectional property-line cleanouts, concrete coring/patching, full compaction, and city permits.",
        "pb_svc_6_best_mat": "100ft SDR-17 HDPE, 2x 4\" ABS two-way cleanout assemblies, cast iron cleanout covers, Class II base rock, tracer wire.",
        "pb_svc_6_best_tools": "High-tonnage hydraulic puller, hydro-excavation vacuum truck (for safe utility crossing), plate compactor, concrete saw.",
        "pb_svc_6_best_time": "3-4 Days",
        "pb_svc_7_title": "Service 7",
        "pb_svc_7_good_just": "[Scope] Standard Non-Condensing Tankless Swap (Exterior). Replaces existing tank with a 199,000 BTU unit. Connects to existing 3/4\" gas line. No electrical modifications.",
        "pb_svc_7_good_mat": "Takagi or Rinnai non-condensing unit, dedicated tankless isolation valve kit, Category III stainless steel vent hood.",
        "pb_svc_7_good_tools": "Gas sniffer (combustible gas detector), hammer drill, pipe threader.",
        "pb_svc_7_good_time": "4-6 hrs",
        "pb_svc_7_better_just": "[Scope] Premium High-Efficiency Condensing Installation. Replaces standard tank. Includes retrofitting Schedule 40 PVC venting, acid neutralizer kit, and upgrading gas line from 1/2\" to 3/4\" (up to 10ft).",
        "pb_svc_7_better_mat": "Navien NPE-A2 Condensing Unit, 2\" or 3\" Solid Core Schedule 40 PVC pipe, condensate neutralizer cartridge, Webstone isolation valves.",
        "pb_svc_7_better_tools": "Testo Combustion Analyzer, ProPress, PVC cutting tools, digital manometer (for gas pressure check).",
        "pb_svc_7_better_time": "6-8 hrs",
        "pb_svc_7_best_just": "[Scope] Ultra-Premium Dual-Unit Cascaded System with built-in recirculation. Endless hot water for luxury homes (4+ baths). Includes custom unistrut rack mounting and smart WiFi integration.",
        "pb_svc_7_best_mat": "2x Navien NPE-240A2 units, Ready-Link cascade cable manifold kit, smart controller, heavy-gauge Unistrut, vibration isolators.",
