        "pb_svc_9_good_just": "[Scope] Standard Residential Hydro-Jetting for a secondary line (kitchen/laundry). Removes gárease and sludge buildup (up to 50 feet). Up to 2,000 PSI.",
        "pb_svc_9_good_mat": "Bio-enzymatic drain treatment (preventative), heavy-duty drop cloths.",
