        "cv_summary_p": "C-36 Specialist and AI Solutions Specialist with over 21 years of multi-disciplinary experience. Expert in bridging complex physical technical plumbing systems with cutting-edge Artificial Intelligence. Licensed professional with a proven track record in California project management and ISO 14001 environmental auditing.",
